    "https://www.paycomonline.net/v4/ats/web.php/portal/06E60EB4A3425A1B8B2E3A5F3F1E2A6F/jobs/96638": {
      "title": "Adjunct Nursing Clinical Faculty",
      "description": "Adjunct Nursing Clinical Faculty You need to enable JavaScript to run this app. Careers Sign In Create Account Adjunct Nursing Clinical Faculty Apply Overview Position Type Faculty Job Shift Part time Education Level Graduate Degree Apply Description University of Lynchburg School of Nursing is seeking applicants for adjunct positions to teach clinical courses beginning in October and January. Day and Evening clinical assignments are available. Qualifications Requirements: Master's Degree in Nursing required RN licensure in state of Virginia or Compact state required Proof of License will be required at time of employment Employment is contingent upon satisfactory background check. Transcripts must be submitted to be considered for review. Unofficial transcripts or a copy of the transcript is acceptable for application purposes. Official transcripts will be required upon hire.  Cover letter should address areas of specialty and availability. The University of Lynchburg is committed to diversity within its community and welcomes applications from persons of color, women, Indigenous/aboriginal people of North America, persons with disabilities, the LGBTQIA+ community, and others who may contribute to the further diversification of the University of Lynchburg community. The University of Lynchburg is an equal opportunity employer. Terms of Use | Privacy Policy | © 2026 Paycom | All Rights Reserved. X This website uses cookies to customize and improve your experience. If you are a California resident, you may be entitled to certain rights regarding your personal information. Additional information about our data collection practices and location specific notices is available on our privacy policy. Accept Cookies"
